# The simulator's card and internal flash: all of it is local state and none of it belongs in git. sd/ holds downloaded books
# (tools/fetch-books.sh) and paperos_config with the Home Assistant token and Wi-Fi password; data/ holds wifi.json (passwords),
# the inbox cache (private messages), power.csv, refresh.log, app state. Test data lives in tests/ui/data and tests/fixtures.
sim-data/
# pioarduino "hybrid compile" (platformio.ini custom_sdkconfig) writes these into the project root: generated from
# platformio.ini and the ESP-IDF defaults, or downloaded (managed_components, ~600 MB).
managed_components/
.dummy/
sdkconfig.defaults
sdkconfig.papers3
CMakeLists.txt
dependencies.lock

# Python bytecode caches (tools/)
__pycache__/

# The docs site (site/): dependencies, build output and the pages generated from docs/ by scripts/sync-docs.mjs
site/node_modules/
site/dist/
site/.astro/
site/src/content/docs/
site/public/screens/
